[
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0593",
    "en": "  Oh really... Well... If it's for your{SAUT}sake, I guess...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "  Ah ouais... Bon... Si c'est pour toi,{SAUT}j'imagine...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0594",
    "en": " ...Ugh, whaddaya mean, \"why?\"(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": " ...Ugh, comment ça, \"pourquoi?\"(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0595",
    "en": "  Oh, that's kinda cool! I'll copy you!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "  Ah, c'est plutôt classe! Je te copie!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0596",
    "en": "  Hey, sounds good! Let's destroy the{SAUT}world, then we'll...! Huh? No?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "  Hé, ça me va! Détruisons le monde,{SAUT}et après on...! Hein? Non?(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0597",
    "en": " Why ya gotta put it that way...?{SAUT}Th-That's cold!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": " Pourquoi tu dis ça comme ça...?{SAUT}C-C'est froid!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0598",
    "en": "   Why ya gotta be all cold!? You don't{SAUT}get demons at all!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "   Pourquoi t'es si froid!? Tu comprends{SAUT}rien aux démons!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0599",
    "en": "What, are you worried about me? Damn,{SAUT}man... I'm touched...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Quoi, tu t'inquiètes pour moi? Merde,{SAUT}mec... ça me touche...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0600",
    "en": "I-I knew it! You're gonna shut me up!{SAUT}I'll be killed or locked away forever!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "J-Je le savais! Tu vas me faire taire!{SAUT}Je serai tué ou enfermé à jamais!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0601",
    "en": "   That was a joke? C'mon, [FFF3],{SAUT}if ya don't laugh, they'll kill ya...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "   C'était une blague? Allez, [FFF3],{SAUT}si tu ris pas, ils te tuent...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0602",
    "en": "   Hyahaha! Good one! But I ain't gonna{SAUT}be fooled!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "   Hyahaha! Bien joué! Mais on me la{SAUT}fait pas!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0603",
    "en": "Ha, brings back memories. I was kinda{SAUT}like that once... Maybe I should relive{SAUT}those days!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Ha, ça me rappelle des souvenirs.{SAUT}J'étais un peu comme ça, avant...{SAUT}Je devrais revivre ce temps-là!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0604",
    "en": "  So it's something you've gotta do, even{SAUT}if you don't believe in it. Hm. I see...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "  Donc c'est un truc à faire même si{SAUT}t'y crois pas. Hm. Je vois...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0605",
    "en": "   You don't know? How am I supposed to let{SAUT}a fool like you control me!?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "   Tu sais pas? Comment je pourrais{SAUT}laisser un sot comme toi me commander!?(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0606",
